deliverables/design/**
!deliverables/design/check_contract.py
!deliverables/design/liquid-glass/
deliverables/design/liquid-glass/**
!deliverables/design/liquid-glass/scripts/
!deliverables/design/liquid-glass/scripts/**

# QA 截图与探针（每轮 40MB+，靠 git 之外的备份）
qa/

# 一次性调试脚本与调研产物
outputs/
attachments/

# 早期产品/评审/度量文档（R12-R44 时代）
deliverables/code-review/
deliverables/product-strategy/
deliverables/gstack/
deliverables/metrics/
deliverables/scripts/
deliverables/reference/
deliverables/security/

